tps://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","number":24,"title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-04-02T11:48:03Z","updated_at":"2026-04-22T15:10:32Z","closed_at":"2026-04-22T15:10:32Z","assignee":{"login":"blueskythlikesclouds","id":19259897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MjU5ODk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19259897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds","html_url":"https://github.com/blueskythlikesclouds","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.6.1.stable.official [14d19694e]\n\nTested under both vulkan and d3d12 on forward+\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.1.stable - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 6700 XT (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 32.0.21043.5001) - AMD Ryzen 7 5800X 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 31.92 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nHi! Under the d3d12 backend, creating a pipeline via compute_pipeline_create on a local rendering device which uses a shader containing gl_NumWorkGroups errors out with 0x80070057\n\nScript:\n\n```gdscript\n\tvar device = RenderingServer.create_local_rendering_device()\n\t\n\tvar shader_file = load('./shader.glsl')\n\tvar spirv = shader_file.get_spirv()\n\tvar shader = device.shader_create_from_spirv(spirv)\n\t\n\tvar _pipeline = device.compute_pipeline_create(shader) # <- error here\n```\n\nShader:\n\n```C\n#[compute]\n#version 460\n\nvoid main() {\n    uint map_size = gl_NumWorkGroups.x;\n}\n```\n\nThese are the errors you get:\n\n```\nE 0:00:00:574   pipeline.gd:12 @ _ready(): Create(Compute)PipelineState failed with error 0x80070057.\n  <C++ Error>   Condition \"!((HRESULT)(res) >= 0)\" is true. Returning: PipelineID()\n  <C++ Source>  drivers/d3d12/rendering_device_driver_d3d12.cpp:5451 @ compute_pipeline_create()\n  <Stack Trace> pipeline.gd:12 @ _ready()\n\nE 0:00:00:574   pipeline.gd:12 @ _ready(): Condition \"!pipeline.driver_id\" is true. Returning: RID()\n  <C++ Source>  servers/rendering/rendering_device.cpp:4341 @ compute_pipeline_create()\n  <Stack Trace> pipeline.gd:12 @ _ready()\n```\n\nThis doesn't occur on the vulkan backend which works without problems, both on AMD and Nvidia. Tested on forward+. I have an AMD GPU, and do not know if the d3d12 issue reproduces on Nvidia. If this becomes a problem, please let me know and I'll help\n\nThis is extracted from a much larger project where `map_size` can't be optimised away, so it doesn't seem to be a simple case of trivial-shader-itus. This issue can be worked around, but the godot ocean waves fft plugin crashes due to this problem on d3d12 which is how I tracked it down - so i thought it was worth reporting\n\nIf you need any more information (or I've messed up this bug report), please let me know and I'll fix it. Thanks!\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nRun the main scene (main.tscn) and check the debugger output. This is configured to show the d3d12 error. If you want to check the vulkan backend, simply swap to it in the settings and repeat: the debugger output is empty\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nhttps://github.com/20k/godot_bug0/tree/master\n\nor a zip if that's easier:\n\n[godot-bug-dx-12.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26435903/godot-bug-dx-12.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118113/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118113/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}